Grintion-OS 1.0.0
Minimal - Independent - Secure - Stable

Useful commands:
  grintion-install --help   install to a disk
  grintion-persist          create persistent live storage
  grintion-chroot /mnt      enter an installed system
  garb --help               package manager
  sv status /var/service/*  service status
  nft list ruleset          firewall rules

The live root is an overlay. Reboots discard changes unless persistence is active.
